# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
# Anchored, so it means the Vite build output at the repo root and not any
# directory that happens to be called dist. Unanchored, it also swallowed
# `qa/dist/` — the suite that checks the build output (#135) — which git then
# refused to track, silently, because an ignored path is not an error.
/dist
dist-ssr
*.local

